# CODEOWNERS
# Routes PRs to the right reviewer based on which files changed.
# GitHub auto-requests review from the matching owner(s) below.
#
# This is a solo portfolio project, so all services point to the same
# owner (@apra) — the routing pattern is what's being demonstrated here,
# not genuine multi-person ownership. Noted in the README as well.

# Each service is "owned" by a different persona in a real team; here
# they all resolve to the same person to demonstrate the mechanism.
/auth-service/          @apra
/orders-service/        @apra
/notifications-service/ @apra

# Shared/root-level files require review from a platform owner,
# since changes here affect every team.
/.github/                @apra
/README.md                @apra
